 "facts": [
  "Evan said Evan began painting after a friend gave Evan a painting that inspired Evan. Evan joined painting classes to meet like-minded people, show what Evan could do, and improve Evan's skills.",
  "Sam expressed interest in starting weightlifting and asked Evan for advice.",
  "Sam said Sam planned to find someone who could help with weightlifting and would keep Evan updated on Sam’s progress.",
  "On 7 August 2023, Evan recommended a fitness watch to Sam. Evan said the watch tracked his progress, helped with his health goals, and served as a motivating visual reminder to keep going.",
  "As of August 15, 2023, Sam was taking a cooking class to learn to make healthier meals and said the class had been great and taught Sam enjoyable recipes.",
  "Evan planned to try poutine during the February 2024 honeymoon in Canada and said Evan would tell Sam how it went.",
  "On May 24, 2023, Sam was considering painting as a hobby to stay motivated and asked Evan whether painting could help with stress.",
  "On July 27, 2023, Sam said Sam was working on Sam’s health and getting active. Evan offered to work on it together with Sam and support Sam.",
  "On 7 August 2023, Evan said small things people do for themselves can help in the long run, and that consistency and perseverance help people through struggles.",
  "Evan said being in scenic natural places brought back memories of road trips in Evan's car.",
  "On November 21, 2023, Sam said that discomfort was limiting Sam’s movement and that making dietary changes was difficult. Sam also said fitness goals had been hard to reach.",
  "On 19 August 2023, Sam said Sam was on a diet and trying to live healthier, and that sticking with it was tough.",
  "On 14 October 2023, Sam said Sam and a mate were near a lake and were going to try kayaking. Evan offered to recommend a good kayaking spot and suggested planning a kayaking trip together; Sam agreed enthusiastically.",
  "Evan offered to help Sam get started with painting.",
  "On May 20–21, 2023, Evan took his family on a road trip to Jasper, drove along the Icefields Parkway, and enjoyed the glaciers, lakes, and a cozy cabin surrounded by mountains and forests.",
  "On 25 October 2023, Sam thanked Evan for being supportive while Sam worked on a health routine.",
  "On 9 November 2023, Evan said Evan had received a 1968 Kustom K-200A vintage guitar as a gift from a close friend.",
  "On 25 October 2023, Evan said that a morning walk helped Evan start the day actively.",
  "On 14 October 2023, Evan shared a photograph of a painting depicting a person on a cliff. Evan said Evan had just finished painting a sunset and that painting helped Evan relax.",
  "Evan has a peaceful favorite spot by the beach near Evan's home where Evan often relaxes and unwinds. Evan said Evan took a photo of a person walking on the beach with a surfboard there on Friday, 3 November 2023; watching the waves and sunset colors helps Evan find peace, especially during tough times.",
  "Evan said Evan's family means the world to Evan and is Evan's rock. Evan looked forward to expanding the family and creating more memories.",
  "Between 4 and 10 January 2024, Sam took a photo in the countryside showing a field, a fence, and a dirt road.",
  "On 14 October 2023, Sam said Sam and a mate were traveling through Lake Tahoe and that Sam had heard Lake Tahoe was great for kayaking. Evan agreed that Lake Tahoe was a good choice, praising its clear water and views.",
  "Evan said that Evan had struggled with Evan’s health a few years before July 27, 2023, and stuck with making changes. Evan shared a gym membership card as a reminder of Evan’s commitment, and said that diet and lifestyle changes also play a big role alongside exercise.",
  "On January 10, 2024, Sam said Sam had made a meal plan and workout schedule and intended to start following the plan that day, motivated by something Sam had seen. Sam shared a photo of a whiteboard with writing on it.",
  "Evan said painting helped Evan find peace and express himself, and that Evan was not taking any other classes at that time.",
  "Evan enjoys watercolor painting and began painting a few years before May 18, 2023. A friend introduced Evan to watercolor painting, offered advice, and Evan quickly became enthusiastic about it.",
  "Evan twisted Evan's knee on Friday, August 25, 2023. The injury was very painful and made it difficult for Evan to keep up with Evan's usual fitness routine; staying active is very important to Evan.",
  "Evan described the island as a peaceful, serene retreat where Evan feels peaceful and serene.",
  "On 14 October 2023, Sam shared a photograph of kayaks lined up on a river shore.",
  "On 25 October 2023, Evan encouraged Sam to take things one day at a time and celebrate small victories; Sam said that focusing on small wins sounded like a plan.",
  "Evan encouraged Sam to be patient, noting that progress takes time, and expressed support for Sam’s health goals.",
  "On 7 August 2023, Evan said he had been dealing with health issues. Evan said he had been working on his health for two years and had experienced ups and downs. Evan said his family motivated him to stay healthy and that health challenges made him appreciate good moments more.",
  "On 19 August 2023, Sam said Sam would like to try skiing but was unsure whether Sam's body could handle it. Evan said Evan would like Sam to join in winter activities someday.",
  "Sam said on July 27, 2023, that Sam was reducing Sam’s soda and candy intake, found it tough, and was determined to make a change. Sam had tried flavored seltzer water before and liked it.",
  "On June 6, 2023, Sam said Sam was trying to eat healthier, but had made no dietary changes and still enjoyed soda and candy. Sam agreed to try flavored seltzer instead of soda and high-cocoa dark chocolate instead of candy.",
  "On 8 October 2023, Sam said Evan’s support meant a lot to Sam and said Sam would stay positive, keep going, and take things slowly.",
  "Sam said Sam had started enjoying morning runs as a way to clear Sam's head.",
  "In summer 2023, Evan went kayaking on a lake and watched the sunset. Evan described the experience as unforgettable and being on the water as peaceful; Evan shared a photo taken from the front of a kayak.",
  "Sam told Evan on July 27, 2023, that Evan’s support meant a lot and that Sam appreciated it. Evan said Evan was there if Sam needed support and encouraged Sam to keep going."
 ],
